WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Check the model, dimensions and parts list. Keep the exact manufacturer manual beside you.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Protect your work surface. Sort the supplied panels and connectors before assembly.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
Dry-fit the base and sides in the manufacturer sequence. Never force or substitute parts.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Check cabinet diagonals and alignment, then secure the specified connectors without overtightening.

00:32.000 --> 00:40.000
Fit and adjust doors or drawers using the model instructions. Keep the service space clear.

00:40.000 --> 00:48.000
Pause before plumbing or mounting. Review the sink template, trap, valves and support with the installer.
